+# Opening import: lines of name,period,amount (blank lines are skipped): a person on the sheet by name or alias
+# (ignoring case), a period on the sheet, an amount of two decimals, 0.00 or more. Every line is checked first; any
+# line refused refuses the whole import (400) and nothing is added. Otherwise each line, in order, adds its amount to
+# the person's carried figure for the period (OPENING_SET). Answers how many lines went through.
